    "Three volumes only (50K, 1M, 2M posts). The todo's 1/10/100/500M percentile series was not run: 2M posts occupy 7.9 GB, so 500M posts project to ~2 TB against ~46 GB free on this machine, and seeding alone extrapolates from 13 min at 2M to ~38 h before measurement; 100M (~400 GB) also exceeds disk.",
